Here is the 18-scene illustrated story plan for a fantasy rescue mission, in strict JSON format.

```json
{
  "title": "The Broken Crown Rescue",
  "scenes": [
    {
      "scene_number": 1,
      "caption": "A lone messenger arrives at the ruined city gates.",
      "visual_description": "Dawn light filters through crumbling stone archways; torn royal banners flap above the entrance; a hooded figure approaches on horseback.",
      "characters": ["Messenger"]
    },
    {
      "scene_number": 2,
      "caption": "Frightened townspeople whisper in the shadow of a collapsed tower.",
      "visual_description": "Crowd huddles near a market square with broken stalls; children cling to parents; a crier shouts warnings about the cursed tower.",
      "characters": ["Townspeople", "Town Crier"]
    },
    {
      "scene_number": 3,
      "caption": "A patrol of armored guards blocks the main road.",
      "visual_description": "Sun glints off dented breastplates; the guards stand in formation before a barricade of rubble and spikes; one officer raises a hand to halt.",
      "characters": ["Guard Captain", "Armored Patrol"]
    },
    {
      "scene_number": 4,
      "caption": "The rescue team gathers in a hidden alcove to plan.",
      "visual_description": "Low torchlight on stone walls; a map unrolled on a crate; four figures lean in, speaking in hushed tones.",
      "characters": ["Rook", "Elara", "Finn", "Mira"]
    },
    {
      "scene_number": 5,
      "caption": "They pass through a magic door that reads riddles.",
      "visual_description": "Doorway carved with glowing runes; a spectral face forms in the wood; the adventurers hesitate as the riddle appears in the air.",
      "characters": ["Rook", "Elara", "Finn", "Mira", "Magic Door"]
    },
    {
      "scene_number": 6,
      "caption": "Inside a cursed tower, the team finds false treasures.",
      "visual_description": "Piles of gold and jewels on velvet altars; enchanted light gleams from a floating crown; the air shimmers with illusion magic.",
      "characters": ["Rook", "Elara", "Finn", "Mira"]
    },
    {
      "scene_number": 7,
      "caption": "A dragon's shadow passes over the upper courtyard.",
      "visual_description": "Massive winged shape darkens the broken flagstones; wind whips loose banners; characters press against walls looking up.",
      "characters": ["Rook", "Elara", "Finn", "Mira", "Dragon"]
    },
    {
      "scene_number": 8,
      "caption": "The team discovers a hidden passage behind a false wall.",
      "visual_description": "Stone panel slides open to reveal a narrow stairwell; dust motes dance in a shaft of light; a skeletal key hangs on a hook.",
      "characters": ["Rook", "Elara", "Finn", "Mira"]
    },
    {
      "scene_number": 9,
      "caption": "They free the first prisoner from a rusted cage.",
      "visual_description": "Iron cage suspended from the ceiling; the prisoner reaches through bars; Elara picks the lock while Finn watches the corridor.",
      "characters": ["Rook", "Elara", "Finn", "Mira", "Prisoner"]
    },
    {
      "scene_number": 10,
      "caption": "A trap triggers in the armory—crossbows fire from walls.",
      "visual_description": "Bolts fly across a dusty armory; shields and swords clatter; Rook dives behind a rack while Mira deflects a bolt with her staff.",
      "characters": ["Rook", "Elara", "Finn", "Mira"]
    },
    {
      "scene_number": 11,
      "caption": "The guard captain confronts them at the second gate.",
      "visual_description": "Captain stands with drawn sword; armored patrol fills the archway behind; torches flare in the narrow passage.",
      "characters": ["Guard Captain", "Armored Patrol", "Rook", "Elara", "Finn", "Mira"]
    },
    {
      "scene_number": 12,
      "caption": "They release a second prisoner from a magic circle.",
      "visual_description": "Glowing runes on the floor bind a kneeling figure; Elara recites a counter-spell as the runes flicker and fade.",
      "characters": ["Elara", "Rook", "Finn", "Mira", "Second Prisoner"]
    },
    {
      "scene_number": 13,
      "caption": "A rumor turns real: a young dragon blocks the treasury door.",
      "visual_description": "Small but fierce dragon coils before a jeweled door; smoke curls from its nostrils; the team draws weapons cautiously.",
      "characters": ["Dragon", "Rook", "Elara", "Finn", "Mira"]
    },
    {
      "scene_number": 14,
      "caption": "They trick the dragon using a mirrored shield.",
      "visual_description": "Finn holds up a polished shield; the dragon sees its own reflection and rears back; the team slips past into the treasury.",
      "characters": ["Finn", "Dragon", "Rook", "Elara", "Mira"]
    },
    {
      "scene_number": 15,
      "caption": "The final prisoner is found in a throne room illusion.",
      "visual_description": "Throne made of bones sits on a dais; an illusory king laughs; the real prisoner is chained beneath the throne.",
      "characters": ["Rook", "Elara", "Finn", "Mira", "Final Prisoner"]
    },
    {
      "scene_number": 16,
      "caption": "The alarm rises as they flee the palace.",
      "visual_description": "Bells toll; guards pour from side streets; the team runs with the prisoners across a courtyard full of fallen columns.",
      "characters": ["Rook", "Elara", "Finn", "Mira", "Prisoner", "Second Prisoner", "Final Prisoner", "Armored Patrol"]
    },
    {
      "scene_number": 17,
      "caption": "The final escape: crossing the crumbling bridge.",
      "visual_description": "Narrow stone bridge over a ravine; missing sections and loose stones; characters leap across while the bridge begins to collapse behind them.",
      "characters": ["Rook", "Elara", "Finn", "Mira", "Prisoner", "Second Prisoner", "Final Prisoner"]
    },
    {
      "scene_number": 18,
      "caption": "The survivors watch the city burn from the hilltop.",
      "visual_description": "Distant flames lick the ruined skyline; the rescued prisoners embrace; the team stands together, exhausted but victorious, as dawn breaks.",
      "characters": ["Rook", "Elara", "Finn", "Mira", "Prisoner", "Second Prisoner", "Final Prisoner"]
    }
  ]
}
```

